            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 7 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 shadow-xs">
            <button class="faq-toggle w-full text-left p-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 focus:outline-none group">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <span class="inline-block self-start bg-primary-container/10 text-primary px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md font-label-md text-[11px] font-semibold">
                        <span>Booking</span>
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-md text-base md:text-lg text-on-background group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-snug">
                        <span>Why is the time slot 21:00-02:59 unavailable for booking?</span>
                    </h3>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-icon p-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container/50 text-primary flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </div>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/10">
                <span>The time slot from 21:00 to 02:59 is unavailable for booking because it falls outside of our operating hours. Please select a different time within our available service hours for your appointment.</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 8 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 shadow-xs">
            <button class="faq-toggle w-full text-left p-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 focus:outline-none group">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <span class="inline-block self-start bg-primary-container/10 text-primary px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md font-label-md text-[11px] font-semibold">
                        <span>Booking & Confirmation</span>
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-md text-base md:text-lg text-on-background group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-snug">
                        <span>How long will it take to receive a confirmation after booking an appointment?</span>
                    </h3>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-icon p-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container/50 text-primary flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </div>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/10">
                <span>You should receive a confirmation email immediately after booking your appointment. If you do not receive it within a few minutes, please check your spam/junk folder or contact our Makeup artist team for assistance. (booking is pending first, confirmation admin will whatsapp you to confirm the booking)</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 9 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 shadow-xs">
            <button class="faq-toggle w-full text-left p-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 focus:outline-none group">
